(Acme Inventory Service - Architecture Guide) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Architecture Overview) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Acme Inventory Service follows a three-tier architecture: a REST API layer, a business) Tj T*
(service layer, and a PostgreSQL persistence layer. Clients communicate over HTTPS using) Tj T*
(JSON payloads.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(An NGINX reverse proxy terminates TLS and forwards requests to the Inventory API on port) Tj T*
(8080. A Redis cache stores frequently read product data to reduce database load.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Stock-change events are published asynchronously to a RabbitMQ message queue and consumed) Tj T*
(by the Notification Worker, which sends low-stock email alerts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
