stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 60 740 Td
(2. Components) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(API Gateway \(NGINX\): terminates TLS and applies rate limiting of 100 requests per second) Tj T*
(per client.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Inventory API: a stateless Java Spring Boot application that exposes the /api/v1 REST) Tj T*
(endpoints.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Stock Service: implements business rules such as stock reservations and low-stock) Tj T*
(thresholds.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Notification Worker: consumes stock events from RabbitMQ and emails an alert when the) Tj T*
(stock of a product falls below the configured threshold.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PostgreSQL 16: the primary data store. Backups run nightly at 02:00 UTC and are retained) Tj T*
(for 14 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Redis 7: the product cache, with a default time-to-live of 300 seconds.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
